      ms: 7240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:orsagm'
    '|b||In the lab, cooperation rises with the chance of meeting again. But being an equilibrium isn''t enough: people cooperate a lot only when it''s safe even if they doubt the other side.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11760
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:jqkht4'
    '|a||And theory''s unravelling? In Selten and Stoecker''s 1986 experiment, people cooperated until shortly before the known end.':
      mp3: 
