      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:6o5qdp'
    '|b||Which rule is best is contested. It depends on the noise and on who else is playing.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6240
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1ntnl80'
    '|a||So cooperation emerges when the same players expect to meet again, nobody knows when it ends, and each repays kindness with kindness and betrayal with betrayal, but forgives soon enough.':
